      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PENCIL ME IN (2) drew wide and went back last start but worked home in good style to finish just a head from the winner in second at Wagga. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this better draw. Good enough to put herself in the winners' stall. LOLLIPOP (9) is building towards another win having finished second at her latest appearance at Parkes, beaten 4.5 metres. Not drawn the best so may need a 10/10 drive but with even luck she can take care of this line-up. LINE ME UP BRO NZ (10) is another that may require luck from the back row but was a winner at this circuit and distance two back. CALM REASON (7) scored last start by a nose at Bathurst. Draws for a trail and could be dangerous if he gets the gaps.",
